KV cache estimate for hostile.gguf (llama\u{1b}[31mRED\u{1b}[0m)

  block_count    1
  head_count     1
  head_count_kv  1    multi-head attention
  key_length     32   from llama\u{1b}[31mRED\u{1b}[0m.attention.key_length
  value_length   32   from llama\u{1b}[31mRED\u{1b}[0m.attention.value_length
  cache type     f16  2 bytes per element
  context        16   tokens per sequence
  sequences      1

formula
  K per layer and token = row_size(f16, 1 x 32 = 32) = 64 B
  V per layer and token = row_size(f16, 1 x 32 = 32) = 64 B
  total = sequences x ctx x block_count x (K + V)
        = 1 x 16 x 1 x 128 B
        = 2,048 B (2.00 KiB)
